{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1495034-the-haunting-of-abbeyham-priory","id":1495034,"title":"The Haunting of Abbeyham Priory","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From...","...Beyond the Grave!"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-15T12:45:01-07:00","id":1495034,"title":"The Haunting of Abbeyham Priory","content":"I recently ran The Haunting of Abbeyham Priory*the Jumpstart for They Came from the Grave.<br /> This Storypath game of late 60s, early 70s horror movies delivers a successful mix of ham acting, flashbacks, nostalgia, and a delightful meta system that allows the players to become the actors and take narrative control.<br /> <br /> At times it might be a little too much system, and the skills are a bit alien to me since I have no WoD hinterland. However it is very British and it\u2019s really wonderful to slip into. My players had a great time and so did I.<br /> <br /> Advice: the scenario is too big to run in four hours. Be prepared to cut much of the 19th century, I just did the bit where they meet the wolves. Note that the details and description of the 19th century ritual are excellent and far better than the 1970s, so use it for both, or just the 70s for my game. Not all the rooms need to be explored, just do enough and switch to the denouement. Be prepared to improvise, since I think all players will surprise you.<br /> <br /> The rulebook is easy to read. It\u2019s infused with short period fiction, a deep love for the sources and a cheeky authorial voice. I shall try other Storypath games because of this, but I shall be coming back to this again and again like Christopher Lee as Dracula.<br /> <br /> Here are my maps which I place in the public domain.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AtdBqgq2yuw4ob9RnO7GOKmnIuR4QQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AtdBqgq2yuw4ob9RnO7GOKmnIuR4QQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://1drv.ms/f/s!AtdBqgq2yuw4ob9RnO7GOKmnIuR4QQ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://1drv.ms/f/s!AtdBqgq2yuw4ob9RnO7GOKmnIuR4QQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27092-satbunny","name":"satbunny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}